Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:14.66,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,水面に映った藍
Comment: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:18.14,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,眩しく 揺れる
Comment: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:23.38,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,手探りで 探してた
Comment: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:26.71,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,足りない私
Comment: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:31.46,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,ゆっくりと動き出した
Comment: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:35.76,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,何万年も前から
Comment: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:44.86,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,この時を約束されていたみたいにほら
Comment: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.77,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,風は歌い
Comment: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:50.82,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,雨は語り
Comment: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:52.99,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,たどり着くよ
Comment: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:55.16,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,光のすみかへ
Comment: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:59.41,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,幾重にも 重なってる
Comment: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:03.58,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,この 地球の偶然
Comment: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:03.58,OP-JP-UP,,0,48,90,karaoke,ほし
Comment: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.72,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,影の向こう
Comment: 0,0:01:05.72,0:01:07.90,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,真実の色
Comment: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:10.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,見つけ出すよ
Comment: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.22,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,光のすみかを
Comment: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:16.41,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,一つでも 欠けていたら
Comment: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:25.11,OP-JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,きっと出会えてなかったね
Comment: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:14.66,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,水面裡倒映的靛藍
Comment: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:18.14,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,如此眩目 輕輕搖曳
Comment: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:23.38,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,我雙手摸索著 尋找著
Comment: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:26.71,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個殘缺不足的我
Comment: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:31.46,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,慢慢向前邁出一步
Comment: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:35.76,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,彷彿早在萬年前
Comment: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:44.86,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,就已立下約定之時 你看
Comment: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:48.77,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,微風輕吟
Comment: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:50.82,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,煙雨細語
Comment: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:52.99,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們終將抵達
Comment: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:55.16,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,那光的棲息之處
Comment: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:59.41,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,層層疊疊 交織纏繞
Comment: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:03.58,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,於這星球的偶然
Comment: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.72,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,在那陰影的彼端
Comment: 0,0:01:05.72,0:01:07.90,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,尋得真實的色彩
Comment: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:10.00,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們終將找到
Comment: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.22,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,那光的歸處
Comment: 0,0:01:12.22,0:01:16.41,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,如若少了其中任何一環
Comment: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:25.11,OP-CH,,0,0,0,karaoke,你我定無緣相見吧
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.02,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,=======OP=======
